<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><b><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none">April is National Volunteer Month –
Thank you&nbsp;<span style="background:yellow">&lt;Blood Program Leader Name&gt;!</span></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none">Did you know that 90% of the American
Red Cross workforce is comprised of volunteers? Volunteers are the heart of the
Red Cross, and Blood Program Leaders like YOU are the lifeline to patients in
need. Without your help, we could not fulfill our lifesaving mission. You make
it possible.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none">Thank you for stepping up to help
collect and donate lifesaving blood. By opening your doors, you provide a place
for donors in your community to roll up their sleeve to give.&nbsp;<b><span style="background:yellow">&lt;Insert if BPL is hosting a drive April 1-30&gt;</span></b></span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:red;
background:yellow;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none">&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
background:yellow;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none">This National
Volunteer Month, we are especially grateful to our Blood Program Leaders for
committing to host drives that help the critical need we anticipate in summer
months.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><a href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DXSnFbMTZ1Wg&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctara.hershberger%40redcross.org%7Cb089cc9d2aa24bedef6408dc478797e1%7Cdd5b5d42c0d34ad2b5f160edb3af2771%7C0%7C0%7C638463894884328486%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=FKTImmjAOzIDD5FWAjOfE0JX3RISiDJsj1TrlyS6vEM%3D&amp;reserved=0"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-font-kerning:
0pt;mso-ligatures:none">Hear from the Dandridge family</span></a><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none"> about their journey of perseverance
with sickle cell disease, and their appreciation for all donors that give
blood.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none">On behalf of those we serve, thank you
once again for your tremendous efforts. I look forward to continuing to work
with you, helping save lives of those in need.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
background:yellow;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none">&lt;Account Manager
Name&gt;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:none">PS. Want to pay it forward? Thank <b>your</b>
blood program volunteers using the attached email template.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;color:black;
